# A copy of an ability "for each opponent, ... up to one target ... that player controls" may have new targets (CR 707.10c,
# 115.7d): the slot for each opponent is asked on its own, with the opponent it is for. Riptide Gearhulk enters and its
# trigger targets Bot2's Mox Pearl; Bot1 copies the trigger with Return the Favor and aims the copy at Bot2's Mox Jet. The
# copy puts the Jet into Bot2's library, then the trigger puts the Pearl there.

